Source of the vignette baggingReserve-jss
========================================

The vignette baggingReserve-jss (vignette("baggingReserve-jss")) is the manuscript submitted to
the Journal of Statistical Software, shipped as a precompiled PDF. This directory holds its source:

  baggingReserve-jss.Rnw   knitr source of the PDF (the manuscript with the "nojss" class option
                           and a note under the abstract)
  refs.bib                 its bibliography

The PDF is not rebuilt with the package. Knitting the source reads the deposited results of the
replication material that accompanies the submission (results/, about 7 MB, computed over several
hours with up to 10,000 bootstrap replicates) and its scripts (replication/), and it needs the JSS
LaTeX style files (jss.cls, jss.bst, jsslogo.jpg) from the journal's author instructions
(https://www.jstatsoft.org/). With these in place, in the paper/ directory of the replication
material:

  Rscript -e 'knitr::knit("baggingReserve-jss.Rnw")'
  latexmk -pdf -bibtex baggingReserve-jss.tex

The PDF in the package was knitted with the package version named in its note. The
supplementary material (supplement.Rnw) is part of the replication material, not of the package.
